<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Duratex 1996 net $33.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Duratex 1996 net $33.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Duratex Group, a home building supplier manufacturer, issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			     1996				1995</p>
<p>    Net		    $33.7 million		   N/A</p>
<p>    Gross oper. rev.   $583.8 million		  N/A</p>
<p>    Operating profit   $43.6 million		   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 55-11-2485415))</p>
